00:45:38.000 --> 00:46:30.000
It could be a husband, boyfriend, partner or brother. There are simple scientific tests we can undertake to determine whether they are responsible for her death. I want to stress to people that it is impossible for Steph and Kishko to have been involved in this crime. Get that image out of your mind. He was not the killer. The appeal resulted in 250 calls to police, allowing a list of 90 new suspects to be compiled. All were investigated, but there was no match. Years went by and still no match for the DNA entered the police database. On October 1st, 2005, police received a call from a hotel room in Oldham, 8.5km southeast of Rochdale.

